    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0568",
      "reading_order": 618,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 724.20873681,
        "r": 464.57535141799985,
        "b": 709.2828958877272
      },
      "content": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0569",
      "reading_order": 619,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 695.10277681,
        "r": 540.1038786388001,
        "b": 686.2073449280329
      },
      "content": "To perform the keypad verification/functional test, see Figure 5-1 , then proceed as follows:",
      "hyperlink_hint": true
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0570",
      "reading_order": 620,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58061285120004,
        "t": 671.1030371139,
        "r": 526.8196157011995,
        "b": 662.2076052319328
      },
      "content": "With the infuser in the DELIVERY screen, press the [A] softkey to select line A."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0571",
      "reading_order": 621,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58061285120004,
        "t": 655.6829496319,
        "r": 343.98789533539986,
        "b": 646.7875177499328
      },
      "content": "Verify the PROGRAM screen is displayed."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0572",
      "reading_order": 622,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58051325110004,
        "t": 640.2628621499,
        "r": 360.4834646972001,
        "b": 631.3674302679328
      },
      "content": "Enter a rate of 123 mL/hr and VTBI of 4567."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0573",
      "reading_order": 623,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58051325110004,
        "t": 624.7830146079,
        "r": 539.9788805133003,
        "b": 604.4872556798329
      },
      "content": "Press [START] and verify the 'CONFIRM PROGRAM?' message is displayed. If rate and VTBI are correct, press [YES]."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0574",
      "reading_order": 624,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.5805132511,
        "t": 597.9028400198,
        "r": 539.8033851371014,
        "b": 577.6070810917329
      },
      "content": "Verify fluid is pumping, the message 'PUMPING' is displayed in the line A status bar, and the line A LED flashes."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0575",
      "reading_order": 625,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.5805132511,
        "t": 571.0226654317,
        "r": 438.0629785881995,
        "b": 562.1272335497329
      },
      "content": "Press [STOP], then press and hold the [BACKPRIME] softkey."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0576",
      "reading_order": 626,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.5805132511,
        "t": 555.6025779497,
        "r": 539.891033225101,
        "b": 535.2471585617329
      },
      "content": "Verify  the  'BACKPRIMING'  and  'RELEASE  BACKPRIME  TO  STOP'  messages are displayed, and verify the infuser is actually backpriming."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0577",
      "reading_order": 627,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58061285119999,
        "t": 528.7225029617001,
        "r": 539.9448172791002,
        "b": 508.3670835737329
      },
      "content": "Release  the  [BACKPRIME]  softkey,  press  [START],  and  verify  normal  pumping operation."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0578",
      "reading_order": 628,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58041365100001,
        "t": 501.8424279737001,
        "r": 243.01819436029987,
        "b": 492.9469960917329
      },
      "content": "Press the [B] softkey."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0579",
      "reading_order": 629,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.40022744600002,
        "t": 486.42234049170014,
        "r": 540.0079637425004,
        "b": 466.0669211037329
      },
      "content": "Verify PIGGYBACK is the displayed delivery mode. If necessary, change the delivery mode by pressing the [CHANGE MODE] softkey."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0580",
      "reading_order": 630,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.40122344700002,
        "t": 459.54226550370015,
        "r": 360.482269496,
        "b": 450.6468336217329
      },
      "content": "Enter a rate of 890 mL/hr and VTBI of 2 mL."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0581",
      "reading_order": 631,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.40122344700002,
        "t": 444.06241796170013,
        "r": 540.0083621429002,
        "b": 423.7666590336329
      },
      "content": "Press [START] and verify the 'CONFIRM PROGRAM?' message is displayed. If rate and VTBI are correct, press [YES]."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0582",
      "reading_order": 632,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.40142264720002,
        "t": 417.1822433736001,
        "r": 539.9888405232999,
        "b": 396.88648444553286
      },
      "content": "Verify fluid is pumping, the message 'PUMPING' is displayed in the line B status bar, and the line B LED flashes."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0583",
      "reading_order": 633,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.40251824829998,
        "t": 390.30206878550007,
        "r": 414.9229869552994,
        "b": 381.40663690353284
      },
      "content": "After 20 seconds, verify pumping has switched to line A."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0584",
      "reading_order": 634,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.40251824829998,
        "t": 374.8819813035001,
        "r": 205.9579931513001,
        "b": 365.98654942153286
      },
      "content": "Press [STOP]."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0585",
      "reading_order": 635,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.40251824829998,
        "t": 359.4618938215001,
        "r": 497.38111294449976,
        "b": 350.56646193953287
      },
      "content": "Press [OPTIONS/VOL INF]. Select Volume Infused and press [CHOOSE]."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0586",
      "reading_order": 636,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.4025182483,
        "t": 343.9820462795001,
        "r": 203.49886668230016,
        "b": 335.08661439753286
      },
      "content": "Select line A."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0587",
      "reading_order": 637,
      "section": "KEYPAD VERIFICATION/FUNCTIONAL TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.4025182483,
        "t": 328.5619587975001,
        "r": 452.47620865930026,
        "b": 319.66652691553287
      },
      "content": "Press [CLEAR]. Verify line A volume is 0 mL and press [ENTER]."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0588",
      "reading_order": 638,
      "section": "5.2.9",
      "bbox": {
